{"matched":97,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0477a01","n":"0477a","t":"華嚴一乘教義分齊章卷第一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0477b01","n":"0477b","t":"所指車所住處而不得故後更"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0477c01","n":"0477c","t":"車得未曾有非本所望亦不可"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0478a01","n":"0478a","t":"是此中四地以去至七地者是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0478b01","n":"0478b","t":"別如此經賢首品云一切世界"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0478c01","n":"0478c","t":"修答有四句一由即一故不待"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0479a01","n":"0479a","t":"即大乘也四約殊勝門即以三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0479b01","n":"0479b","t":"諸煩惱但能折伏一切煩惱故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0479c01","n":"0479c","t":"此有三義一則融一乘同大乘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0480a01","n":"0480a","t":"非三如上果海此四義中隨於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0480b01","n":"0480b","t":"一教此如法華經說若先於一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0480c01","n":"0480c","t":"依大衍法師等一時諸德立四"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0481a01","n":"0481a","t":"乘等者是也四名圓教為法界"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0481b01","n":"0481b","t":"等諸德豈夫好異但以備窮三"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0481c01","n":"0481c","t":"眾味隨其所欲諸佛世尊亦復"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0482a01","n":"0482a","t":"俗皆假以虛妄故出世法皆實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0482b01","n":"0482b","t":"始終俱離云云五圓教中三始"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0482c01","n":"0482c","t":"等廣如經說是故依此普聞一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0483a01","n":"0483a","t":"有義亦攝人天等法亦與一乘"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0483b01","n":"0483b","t":"堪入終教即便定者即初時見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0483c01","n":"0483c","t":"分見聞及解行處說十或有眾"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0484a01","n":"0484a","t":"說耶答彼經但云在光曜宮殿"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0484b01","n":"0484b","t":"則具信等六位一一位中所有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0484c01","n":"0484c","t":"華嚴一乘教義分齊章卷第一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0485a01","n":"0485a","t":"教於此賴耶識得理事融通二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0485b01","n":"0485b","t":"生死依如來藏有涅槃等乃至"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0485c01","n":"0485c","t":"如舍利弗等雖於此中說佛一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0486a01","n":"0486a","t":"初習為習種性久習積成為性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0486b01","n":"0486b","t":"何者謂修六度串習行已位到"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0486c01","n":"0486c","t":"如經說言眾生亦爾悉皆有心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0487a01","n":"0487a","t":"有佛性餘一切人皆不說有若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0487b01","n":"0487b","t":"一佛若一劫若過一劫晝夜說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0487c01","n":"0487c","t":"性必是有為如何此教約真如"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0488a01","n":"0488a","t":"有二說一攝前諸教所明種性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0488b01","n":"0488b","t":"說問何故小乘行位等相不廣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0488c01","n":"0488c","t":"別立四善根為加行位見等同"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0489a01","n":"0489a","t":"十迴向方皆不退也當知此中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0489b01","n":"0489b","t":"住位方得不退故十住初即不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0489c01","n":"0489c","t":"進分上得一切位及佛地者是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0490a01","n":"0490a","t":"佛作大佛事饒益眾生不可說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0490b01","n":"0490b","t":"信滿不退方得入位今即寄彼"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0490c01","n":"0490c","t":"阿僧祇仍此教中就釋迦身以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0491a01","n":"0491a","t":"可計數解云此中不可計數者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0491b01","n":"0491b","t":"八地已上以智障為緣受變易"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0491c01","n":"0491c","t":"寄此聲聞羅漢以得四諦法故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0492a01","n":"0492a","t":"華嚴一乘教義分齊章卷第二"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0492b01","n":"0492b","t":"不同有其四種等亦如下指若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0492c01","n":"0492c","t":"瞋唯欲界以上二界煩惱皆有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0493a01","n":"0493a","t":"未至定發出世道頓斷三界一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0493b01","n":"0493b","t":"也又梁攝論既云留種子是故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0493c01","n":"0493c","t":"聲聞於煩惱障尚不能斷但能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0494a01","n":"0494a","t":"不分見修至初地時正使俱盡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0494b01","n":"0494b","t":"起惑滅非初非中後前中後取"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0494c01","n":"0494c","t":"障清淨能顯應身業障清淨能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0495a01","n":"0495a","t":"相同世間又得大乘光明三昧"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0495b01","n":"0495b","t":"得上界定極至四空定離下地"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0495c01","n":"0495c","t":"同此說如上所引故得知也十"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0496a01","n":"0496a","t":"普賢品明一障一切障小相品"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0496b01","n":"0496b","t":"去有遲疾遲者經劫乃起故楞"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0496c01","n":"0496c","t":"於彼土求佛智慧得聞此經唯"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0497a01","n":"0497a","t":"中修生功德是無常以修生故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0497b01","n":"0497b","t":"身隨緣後義與法身不變是非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0497c01","n":"0497c","t":"義一亦是方便為引二乘即於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0498a01","n":"0498a","t":"隨他受用實報淨土或有說在"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0498b01","n":"0498b","t":"報功德彼論釋為受用身也此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0498c01","n":"0498c","t":"大覺地清淨法界攝法身四智"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0499a01","n":"0499a","t":"約終教說或立十佛以顯無盡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0499b01","n":"0499b","t":"恒不失自性清淨秪由不失自"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0499c01","n":"0499c","t":"計明知理無由理無故得成橫"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0500a01","n":"0500a","t":"並可知矣又問依他有耶答不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0500b01","n":"0500b","t":"如為凝然常者何故不就不異"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0500c01","n":"0500c","t":"也又無所依不得有法即是斷"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0501a01","n":"0501a","t":"有法即是斷也問若說緣生為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0501b01","n":"0501b","t":"反相成也是故如情執無即是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0501c01","n":"0501c","t":"義以緣成無性故準前依他是"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0502a01","n":"0502a","t":"句數四開合五融攝六約教第"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0502b01","n":"0502b","t":"第四句無力不待緣義耶答以"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0502c01","n":"0502c","t":"作時不住故不無因生隨順有"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0503a01","n":"0503a","t":"義是別相六義齊名因是同相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0503b01","n":"0503b","t":"廣辯初喻示者如數十錢法所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0503c01","n":"0503c","t":"成故即一全無力歸於十也仍"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0504a01","n":"0504a","t":"十皆各如前準可知耳言向下"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0504b01","n":"0504b","t":"問若由智者即非先有如何說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0504c01","n":"0504c","t":"一何以故彼初一即是十故更"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0505a01","n":"0505a","t":"為十一教義即攝一乘三乘乃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0505b01","n":"0505b","t":"也然此無盡皆悉在初門中也"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0505c01","n":"0505c","t":"其邊量故此經偈云不可言說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0506a01","n":"0506a","t":"上言一念即得作佛者三乘中"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0506b01","n":"0506b","t":"重重現耶答此方說華嚴經時"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0506c01","n":"0506c","t":"見菩薩從定起又云於彼十方"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0507a01","n":"0507a","t":"或過去劫入未來劫未來劫入"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0507b01","n":"0507b","t":"中即攝餘門無不皆盡應以六"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0507c01","n":"0507c","t":"者或二三四五乃至無量乘此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0508a01","n":"0508a","t":"作舍答未有瓦等時不是椽故"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0508b01","n":"0508b","t":"此可思之問若相即者云何說"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0508c01","n":"0508c","t":"見椽等諸緣各住自法本不作"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T45n1866_p0509a01","n":"0509a","t":"多類自同成於總各體別異現"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-T-T45n1866-華嚴一乘教義分齊章","source":"CBETA T45n1866 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":97,"unit":"T45 頁欄"}